    "galleryCharacter": [
      {
        "key": "Amidst the Ink-Tinged Mist",
        "img": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/1fd3429cf427091ca48cddf01e82a0eb_930202330422553289.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "An inch of ink ground to its end, in a single sweep the mountains one ascends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Hall of a Thousand Pillars",
        "img": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/e3f2270fa4a0d41f6ce9e858a15d3c96_2659155673307892220.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "\"Then let us set our course for the heart of the world. A realm not reserved for the old or the young, rulers or fools.\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Pavilion of Scorching Sands and Blazing Sun",
        "img": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/6fe0ec182e86a72319015ed260a2c78b_906291984492667544.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "\"Behold my great deeds, O mighty ones, and bow before me!\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "The Moving Finger Writes",
        "img": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/710a330479454ff54f13ab3c6a28b79d_7717075510968629555.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "The Path to the Heavens can only be constructed with one's memories and wisdom."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "Of Vastness and the Infinitesimal",
        "img": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/bea9ec84d1ac53277bd965751cd33b0b_8528870777265194611.png",
        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "Life upon life arises from the darkness; death upon death descends into the void."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Trailers and Story Teasers",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Version \"Luna VI\" \"Augured Homecoming\" Trailer"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/c113514a30c57dbead25207f0c110bab_4387546322714079121.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>March 28, 2026</color>\nFrom the moment we open our eyes, we begin to perceive the world.\nWe hear poetry, we hear songs — they guide the fae to the mortal realm, and people into endless time and space.\nThere is no need to feel sorrow for the past or the future, for this world is vast enough to swallow all melancholy.\n<color=#ff9999>Youtube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=mVWLSzkpGzA"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Tutorials",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Temple of Space"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/e4da1290ea14dd24412f5c21ec851ba1_2557771162210005897.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>April 5, 2026</color>\nThe Traveler is about to enter the Ruler of Space's repository, where civilizations from different eras converge. Here, even the rules as we know them begin to break down — space can be folded, unfolded, and reshaped... and the long history of civilization is laid out like a living stage.\nScenes from paintings come to life, sand shaped by hand leaves its mark, and the pages of books open into worlds you can step into... The memories of civilizations await the Traveler."
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Illustrations",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
