        "text": "The \"Trail of Footsteps\" Event Wallpapers"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/b25d902d7dd52fa44c4e0489b3163bdb_8148357775205774456.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>April 8, 2026</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Paimon's Memo: To-Do List for \"Up There\""
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/15/237301566/b59d90b1621893c5f4e56d67a9684e20_785039379654078796.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>April 11, 2026</color>\nPaimon has returned from the Temple of Space with many new items added to her notebook. Let's take a look together!"
      },
