        "text": "Gadgets"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10495,
        "name": "Segment-Domain Treasure Compass",
        "desc": "When used within the Temple of Space, this device detects nearby treasures and the related clues.<br> Even within the hidden vaults where the thousand winds cannot reach, there are still invisible threads that guide the way toward the most precious of collections — as well as the hidden meanings behind them.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/505d6af0a66a2959adcf1c5a93208620_6539251794953001146.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Adventure Items"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10461,
        "name": "Memory Factor",
        "desc": "The fundamental building blocks of \"Civilization.\"<br>Any creation of \"Civilization\" that fades from the collective memory of humanity will eventually disintegrate into Memory Factors. Offer them to the Memory Core within the Temple of Space, and you may receive a blessing from the memories drifting within the interstices...",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/2cfae549501e36e00a1958ef46b6795b_336209856872758630.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10459,
        "name": "Segment-Domain Control Module: Zero Particle",
        "desc": "Collect all 3 Domain Control Modules to unlock the Secret Hall of the Realms.<br><br>You found this strange module by chance while exploring. If you collect three with the same markings, you may be able to open the secret hall within the Temple of Space.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/c97448da6923219aa843f5530469f84a_5394102026197158201.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Radiant Spincrystals"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10491,
        "name": "Radiant Spincrystal 179",
        "desc": "This wondrous crystal contains a certain rhythm, like something beautiful woven from delicate silk. These items can be found throughout the mainland or from merchants who collect curios. The tune held within this crystal can be revivified in your Serenitea Pot using either \"Euphonium Unbound: Winding\" or \"Euphonium Unbound: Soaring.\"",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/33219efde74b002b368e606c6e784ba4_8972385024558742395.png",
