      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Enemies and Monsters"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10552,
        "name": "Domain Keeper",
        "desc": "A shadow construct born from the overflow of the mighty primordial being, it is a guardian who watches over the Pillar Hall of the heavens.<br>Though entrusted with \"eyes\" as a guardian of the Pillar Hall of Space, these entities can do nothing but extol the \"Ideal Forms\" of the noumenal world. With no way to behold the complexities of the phenomenal world, they are thus not counted among the kindred of angels. Whether this inherent contradiction is a product of their creator's rational design, or if the master they serve ultimately failed to grasp the intent of that primordial being, is a truth that remains beyond our reach.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/b59d9cd210ff8e7ede08293e29a63632_7644486823562403791.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10555,
        "name": "\"Maha Vasudevayaputra\"",
        "desc": "Said to be a descendant of an ancient deity widely worshipped in Sumeru, the World-Bestowing Lord, this being exudes an aroma uniquely rich and savory, one unmistakably belonging to fungi. The belief that plump shrooms are gifts from the gods, even manifestations of sacred flesh, has had a long and venerable history in Sumeru. However, the fact that the Dendro Archon bears no evident connection to fungi at all has been a contradiction that has troubled Vahumana researchers for years and years. Nevertheless, should they ever be granted a glimpse of this divine scion's true form, maybe they would also finally have the answer to this long-standing puzzle.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/21492bc61d750250e68bb1b7bb16e47a_8559970710424924784.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
